</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00195/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个旧陶瓷碗，当放置于地面时周围20m为半径的所有人均会掏出他们身上的所有硬币丢入碗内。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███市火车站<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存储于Site-CN-93的收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>小时候，我总希望自己能过上啥也不干也能拿钱的生活……现在看来，这不就是乞丐吗？——██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00195" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00195" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00195-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-xiue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6403030); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6403030&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605841068" alt="Dr_xiue" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6403030)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-xiue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6403030); return false;">Dr_xiue</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589416752 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 May 2020 00:39</span></p>
