<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00403/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一对████公司出品的运动型护腕，其异常表现为会将佩戴者手腕扭伤这一事件发生的概率提高到100%。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Area-CN-15的运动馆内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>活动活动手腕都能扭伤是不是有点太过分了。&#8212;Dr.K</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00403" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00403" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00403-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605841069" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600831602 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Sep 2020 03:26</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶喷雾式杀虫剂，瓶身商标为“鸵鸟”牌。吸入其喷出气雾的人类将无法通过视觉感知到一切蜚蠊科昆虫的存在，持续时间尚不明确。化验显示该物质并无杀虫功效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██厨师刘██宿舍中。刘██对其来历无清晰记忆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低危物品储存柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>在确认持续时间之前千万别放他回去工作！</em>——██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00044" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00044-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1418801&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605841069" alt="ahshow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1418801)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;">ahshow</a></span></p>
